# **Christmas drinks and final end of year performance!**

Well everyone, we hope you have your festive shoes on! We will be finishing the year with a big bang at the last Nights on Ocean market for the year! It has been such a great year with all of our classes and we have met such awesome people through our workshops and classes here on the Sunshine Coast.  We hope you can all make it along for this final event. The performance will be on Friday December 12th at Nights on Ocean Market 6.45pm and the exact set up location is yet to be confirmed. After drumming and dancing, we will be heading to a nearby venue to celebrate the year that was! Yay! See you all there.  Performance pieces and information will be given in class over the next week. Peace, love and rhythm Nat and Bec
